      "section": "dsh-client-ui-vibecontroller",
      "text": "Floating DualSense controller overlay for the [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) web surface: lights up pressed buttons and fires vibe-coding instructions straight from the gamepad."
