    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Live DualSense overlay in the web GUI.\n- Left Stick (L3) — push to move the plugin; hold to show every button's bound function.\n- Options Button - push to show settings including display size and opacity."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install from GitHub",
      "text": "Requires [pnpm](https://pnpm.io/installation) on PATH (used by the `dsh plugin` command).\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:squirrelbullet/dsh-client-ui-vibecontroller"
